sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Svc as EvaluationService
    participant Fact as EvaluationStrategyFactory
    participant Strat as EvaluationStrategy
    participant DB as Relational Database
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Note over Svc: Triggered after Passing Timer & Authorization Gates
    Svc->>Fact: get_strategy(exam.enable_negative_marking)
    Fact-->>Svc: Resolved Strategy Instance (Standard or NegativeMarking)

    loop For each Question in Exam
        Svc->>DB: Record StudentAnswer(attempt_id, question_id, selected_option_id)
        Svc->>Strat: evaluate_question(question, selected_option_id)
        Strat->>Strat: Query question.options (True Server is_correct flag)
        alt Option is Correct
            Strat-->>Svc: +question.marks
        else Option is Incorrect
            alt Negative Marking Enabled
                Strat-->>Svc: -question.negative_marks
            else Standard Mode
                Strat-->>Svc: 0.0
            end
        else Question Unanswered
            Strat-->>Svc: 0.0 (Zero penalty)
        end
        Svc->>Svc: Accumulate total_score += earned
    end

    Svc->>Svc: Apply Underflow Protection: total_score = max(0.0, total_score)
    Svc->>Svc: Compute percentage = (total_score / max_score) * 100
    Svc->>Svc: Compute passed = total_score >= exam.passing_marks
    Svc->>DB: Update attempt.status = SUBMITTED, submitted_at = utcnow()
    Svc->>DB: Insert sealed Result(total_score, max_score, percentage, passed)
    DB-->>Svc: Persisted Sealed Result
    Svc->>Audit: log_event("EVALUATION_COMPLETED", student_id, score, status="SUCCESS")
    Svc-->>Client: ResultOut(total_score, max_score, percentage, passed)